*_files/
_book/
*.tex
*.rmd

# Per-file renders (`quarto render index.qmd`, or rendering one chapter from the
# editor) write HTML next to the source instead of into _book/. The book build
# never needs these, and an unguarded `git add .` would otherwise commit build
# output into the repo.
#
# Both patterns are deliberately narrow: a leading slash keeps `_includes/*.html`
# (real source) visible, and `chapters/*.html` matches only direct children, so
# tracked chapter assets like chapters/BrownBag_RONG_Minha/Brownbag_Network.html
# are untouched.
/*.html
chapters/*.html
